*.nvuser

# MFractors (Xamarin productivity tool) working folder
.mfractor/

# Local History for Visual Studio
.localhistory/

# BeatPulse healthcheck temp database
healthchecksdb

# Backup folder for Package Reference Convert tool in Visual Studio 2017
MigrationBackup/

# Ionide (cross platform F# VS Code tools) working folder
.ionide/

# Fody - auto-generated XML schema
FodyWeavers.xsd
/Wombat.Web/appsettings.Local.json

# Deploy output. `deploy/deploy.sh` and `deploy/deploy.ps1` publish Wombat.Web here with
# `dotnet publish -o publish/` — ~100 MB of binaries at the repo root. There IS a stock
# `publish/` line further up under "# Click-Once directory", but that is Visual Studio
# template boilerplate that matches this path by coincidence of name. This entry is the
# deliberate one: if that dead ClickOnce section is ever pruned, this still holds.
/publish/

# Reference trees, deleted from the worktree 2026-09-20. The rules stay as a guard:
# ClinicAssist lives at C:\Users\Renier\ClinicAssist.NET and the old Wombat is in this
# repo's history at 55a92c6 — neither should ever be vendored back in and committed.
ClinicAssist.NET_ref_DO_NOT_COMMIT/
Wombat_ref_old_DO_NOT_COMMIT/
execution/.dotnet/
EPA Book/chapters/

# EPA Book — third-party copyrighted textbook (ten Cate et al.) and its derived full text.
# `critique.md` and `evaluation.md` in that folder ARE tracked: they are our own analysis and
# contain only citations. The book itself must never enter git history — it is 16MB, it is not
# ours to redistribute, and removing it later would need a history rewrite on a deployed branch.
EPA Book/*.pdf
EPA Book/epa-book.md
EPA Book/epa-book.clean.md
EPA Book/*.py
EPA Book/README.md

# EPA version 11.1.docx — the College's source document behind Tasks/T098-data/*.json.
# Ignored deliberately, not by oversight: its cover reads "DRAFT — FOR DISCUSSION. Content is
# subject to revision", and it is the College's document to distribute, not ours. The derived
# JSON IS committed and is the record this repo relies on. Reverse this line if the College
# confirms v11.1 final and agrees to it living here.
/EPA version *.docx

# Browser-verification artifacts (Playwright MCP cache + ad-hoc screenshots)
.playwright-mcp/
/*.png

# Local dev credentials — kept out of commits manually until now
pwd_DO_NOT_COMMIT.txt

# DB snapshot dumps written by tools/db-snapshot.ps1
recovery/

# Scratch scripts piped to the deploy server over SSH. The folder was emptied on
# 2026-09-20: the five worth keeping are tracked under deploy/verify/, the rest were
# superseded by deploy/README.md's first-boot checklist. The rule stays because ad-hoc
# server scripts are still useful — but NEVER hardcode a credential in one. Two of the
# eighteen did (the DB password, the seed admin password, the unrotatable
# Wombat__PseudonymSalt, the SMTP password), and only this rule kept them out of git.
# Secrets belong in pwd_DO_NOT_COMMIT.txt, or read at runtime from wombat.env.
deploy/.remote/

# Local .NET SDK / workload cache created by tooling in the repo root — never source.
.dotnet/

# rcl-harness runtime stamp: the SessionStart hook writes it, the Stop hook reads it to
# tell whether task state changed this session. Per-machine, not shared state.
execution/.session
.claude/worktrees/

# The scenario replay's published app and logs (tools/scenario-replay.ps1) and its screenshot baseline (T295)
.scenario-app/
/design/baseline/
# What design/tools/stage_upload.ps1 stages for one Claude Design thread (design/BRIEF.md § 3)
/design/upload/

# Secrets and dumps never committed (security survey, 2026-10-05)
*.dump
.env
.env.*
*.env
secrets.json
*.pem
*.key
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*

